    "title": "FSM-Bench-20: Local LLM Benchmark for Deterministic FSM Generation",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20517969",
    "publication_date": "2026-06-03",
    "description": "FSM-Bench-20 is a reproducible benchmark of 20 natural-language requirement specifications for evaluating open-source LLMs on deterministic finite state machine generation under local Ollama inference. The artifact includes the dataset, prompt specification, FSM JSON schema, evaluation scripts, and a completed 140-run campaign freeze (manifest 20260602T195520Z) with headline nested gate rates G1 98.6%, G2 78.6%, and G3 31.4%.",
